1f7b40b7.mp4?t=1786116240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Return to a darker Bolivia to hunt La Llorona in a tense free new mission. Experience enhanced gameplay with 60FPS, 4K graphics, quality-of-life updates, new cosmetics, and more!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/91b8156a65ff6325ff1b9b1546402803.avif?t=1786116240\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras_big/91b8156a65ff6325ff1b9b1546402803.webp?t=1786116240 width=1560 height=81 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/6b527eb3418f46828cf64bb4a4f953dc.poster.avif?t=1786116240\" width=1170 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/6b527eb3418f46828cf64bb4a4f953dc.webm?t=1786116240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/6b527eb3418f46828cf64bb4a4f953dc.mp4?t=1786116240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In a near future, Bolivia has fallen into the hands of a merciless drug cartel. Lead your team of elite soldiers and coordinate raids. Pilot drones and helicopters and drive the wildest vehicles on and off-road as you scour the breathtaking landscapes of Bolivia.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/766840bba9030c31f1ca90a438ed3053.avif?t=1786116240\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras_big/766840bba9030c31f1ca90a438ed3053.webp?t=1786116240 width=1560 height=81 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/ab0475b49eaa0ca88dc44f5c1963ef22.poster.avif?t=1786116240\" width=1170 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/ab0475b49eaa0ca88dc44f5c1963ef22.webm?t=1786116240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/ab0475b49eaa0ca88dc44f5c1963ef22.mp4?t=1786116240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Create your Ghost from scratch and customize your weapons and gear from a library of thousands of different combinations including tactical paint jobs, sleeve tattoos, backpack patches, helmets, and more. Travel in the air and at sea with over 60 different vehicles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/c5c9996cb0a035fabc80d058697f3a97.avif?t=1786116240\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras_big/c5c9996cb0a035fabc80d058697f3a97.webp?t=1786116240 width=1560 height=81 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/3bd26c9fc122e03ee876280023f433e5.poster.avif?t=1786116240\" width=1170 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/3bd26c9fc122e03ee876280023f433e5.webm?t=1786116240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460930/extras/3bd26c9fc122e03ee876280023f433e5.mp4?t=1786116240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Create a team of up to 3 friends. You can also play PvP in 4v4 class-based, tactical fights: Ghost War.", "about_the_game": "Enjoy the ultimate military shooter experience set in a massive, dangerous, and responsive open world.<br><br><